{
  "id": "ep027",
  "duration": 24.143,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 2.68,
      "text": "The most famous cow in history never kicked that lantern.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Mrs OLeary's cow.jpg",
        "credit": "AnonymousUnknown author",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mrs_OLeary%27s_cow.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.667,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 2.68,
      "end": 6.38,
      "text": "On October 8, 1871, a devastating fire broke out on DeKoven Street.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Chicago in Flames by Currier & Ives, 1871.jpg",
        "credit": "Currier and Ives",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chicago_in_Flames_by_Currier_%26_Ives,_1871.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 2.667,
          "end": 6.367,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 6.38,
      "end": 9.9,
      "text": "Fueled by severe drought, the Great Chicago Fire killed about 300 people.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "West entrance to Court House. (21462112062).jpg",
        "credit": "SMU Central University Libraries",
        "license": "No restrictions",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:West_entrance_to_Court_House._(21462112062).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 6.367,
          "end": 9.9,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 9.9,
      "end": 13.52,
      "text": "Seeking a scapegoat, journalist Michael Ahern blamed Irish immigrant Catherine O\u2019Leary.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "View of a drawing) \"The Innocent Cause- or the Origin of Chicago Fire\" (showing Mrs. O'Leary and her cows) (NYPL b11707459-G90F182 013ZF).tiff",
        "credit": "Scan by NYPL",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_of_a_drawing)_%22The_Innocent_Cause-_or_the_Origin_of_Chicago_Fire%22_(showing_Mrs._O%27Leary_and_her_cows)_(NYPL_b11707459-G90F182_013ZF).tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 9.9,
          "end": 13.533,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 13.52,
      "end": 17.1,
      "text": "He claimed her cow kicked a lantern, but O\u2019Leary was asleep in bed.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "View of a drawing) \"The Innocent Cause- or the Origin of Chicago Fire\" (showing Mrs. O'Leary and her cows) (NYPL b11707459-G90F182 013ZF).tiff",
        "credit": "Scan by NYPL",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_of_a_drawing)_%22The_Innocent_Cause-_or_the_Origin_of_Chicago_Fire%22_(showing_Mrs._O%27Leary_and_her_cows)_(NYPL_b11707459-G90F182_013ZF).tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 13.533,
          "end": 17.1,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 17.1,
      "end": 20.54,
      "text": "Ahern later admitted he fabricated the entire story for a colorful headline.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Chicago-fire1.jpg",
        "credit": "John R. Chapin, died 1907",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chicago-fire1.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 17.1,
          "end": 20.533,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 20.54,
      "end": 23.793,
      "text": "Chicago took 126 years to officially clear her name.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Mrs OLeary's cow.jpg",
        "credit": "AnonymousUnknown author",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mrs_OLeary%27s_cow.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 20.533,
          "end": 24.133,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
